    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out if you have what it takes to be a lucid dream experimenter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Initium</i> is a store that sells extraordinary inventions, such as zero-gravity cubes, a 2D banana, and a machine called the <i>Lucider</i>. With this experimental helmet, you can experience lifelike dreams in a virtual environment and solve puzzles on your journey in order to advance to the next dream. Will you be our next experimenter?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A META QUEST HEADSET IS REQUIRED TO PLAY!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tropical island</strong> - Go on vacation to a tropical island and relax after a long day of work! Feel free to sit down on the couch while enjoying the ocean view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-air museum</strong> - Visit a museum filled with ancient artifacts, paintings and interestings hats. Who knows what knowledge you will find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egyptian tomb</strong> - Descend into the depths of an Egyptian tomb and help restore ancient texts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Labyrinth</strong> - Escape corruption by finding the three fuses and free yourself from your demise\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CONTROLS</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Joystick - Walk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Joystick - Turn</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grip Button - Grab</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out if you have what it takes to be a lucid dream experimenter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Initium</i> is a store that sells extraordinary inventions, such as zero-gravity cubes, a 2D banana, and a machine called the <i>Lucider</i>. With this experimental helmet, you can experience lifelike dreams in a virtual environment and solve puzzles on your journey in order to advance to the next dream. Will you be our next experimenter?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A META QUEST HEADSET IS REQUIRED TO PLAY!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tropical island</strong> - Go on vacation to a tropical island and relax after a long day of work! Feel free to sit down on the couch while enjoying the ocean view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-air museum</strong> - Visit a museum filled with ancient artifacts, paintings and interestings hats. Who knows what knowledge you will find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egyptian tomb</strong> - Descend into the depths of an Egyptian tomb and help restore ancient texts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Labyrinth</strong> - Escape corruption by finding the three fuses and free yourself from your demise\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CONTROLS</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Joystick - Walk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Joystick - Turn</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grip Button - Grab</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Initium is a puzzle game with a hint of horror. As an experimenter, you must navigate your way through lucid dreams, such as a tropical island and open-air museum. Solve puzzles in order to advance to the next challenge and eventually return to reality. A Meta Quest headset is required to play.",
